WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.141 --> 00:00:10.029
Everything works from the keyboard (WCAG 2.2 AA). Press ? for the list.

2
00:00:10.029 --> 00:00:13.689
The shortcuts.

3
00:00:13.689 --> 00:00:19.576
/ to search, ↓ to pick, Shift+Enter adds to the watchlist, Enter opens.

4
00:00:19.576 --> 00:00:23.390
On a watchlist row, B buys and S sells.

5
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.971
Type the quantity, Enter to review.

6
00:00:25.971 --> 00:00:29.665
Esc closes and puts focus back where it was.

7
00:00:29.665 --> 00:00:32.414
Focus is always visible, and every change is announced to screen readers.
